senses.gloss:
--an उपद्वीप to जम्बूद्वीप; a great city in Tri- कूट; was besieged by राम and his वानर hosts and made desolate by रावण's indiscretion; विभीषण as king of; जाम्बवती alluded to this incident in praising कृष्ण;
1: भा. V. १९. ३०; IX. १०. १६-33; X. ५६. २८; वा. ४८. २८.
capital of रावण;
2: Br. III. 7. २६६; ६९. ३५; M. ४३. ३७.
conquered by Arjuna; one of the places for residence of Agastya.
3: Ib. ६१. ५१.
